<title>FINLAND: FINNAIR JUNE PASSENGER LOAD FACTOR JUMPS.</title>
<headline>FINNAIR JUNE PASSENGER LOAD FACTOR JUMPS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish national airline Finnair Oy said in a statement on Friday its passenger load factor rose 3.5 percentage points year-on-year in June to 76.7 percent.  </p>
<p>Finnair gave the following statistics:</p>
<p>				   June 1997    May 1997   Yr/yr(pct)</p>
<p> Passengers (thousand)	     633	   580	 +10.8</p>
<p> RPK (million)		     1,062	   904	  +8.2</p>
<p> RTK (million)			 121	   107	 +13.3</p>
<p> Cargo and mail (thousand kg)  6,217	 6,225	 +21.1</p>
<p> Passenger load factor (pct)    76.7	  66.2	  +3.5pts</p>
<p>June 1997 totals broken down by flight type:</p>
<p>			Passengers   RPK	 RTK	    Cargo</p>
<p>			thousand   million    million     thousand kg</p>
<p> International	 346	 738	  92	    5,569</p>
<p> Domestic		192	  82	   7		475</p>
<p> Charter		  95	 242	  22		173</p>
<p>Load factor (percent) by flight type:</p>
<p>				  June 1997   May 1997  Yr/yr(pct pts)</p>
<p> International		  74.7	 62.4	  +4.0</p>
<p> Domestic			 59.0	 55.0	  +0.1</p>
<p>Finnair's financial year runs from April 1 to March 31. RPK - revenue passenger km (revenue passengers carried multiplied by km flown)</p>
<p>RTK - revenue tonne km (tonnage of revenue load carried -- passengers, cargo and mail -- multiplied by km flown. Passenger load factor - RPK as a percentage of available seat km.</p>
<p>Finnair does not give a cargo load factor.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
